# Manual testing for the optional edge-iteration helper (role: nixos_edge_sync).
#
# OFF BY DEFAULT: the role is inert unless enabled. To use it:
#
#   make -f Makefile.NixosEdgeSync run EXTRA_ARGS='-e nixos_edge_sync_enabled=true'
#
# It rsyncs the local Unix_dotfiles checkout into the container bind mount on
# @terra and runs `nixos-rebuild switch --flake` inside the running container.
# The canonical path remains: rebuild the artifact, then `TAGS=image,container`.
